"source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":7,"anchor_node_id":"0:7","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment8:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment8","raw_text":"2。改走炮8平9邀兑，比较稳健。","text":"2。改走炮8平9邀兑，比较稳健。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"0:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"3。可以改走炮1进4去卒，红炮五进四去卒，马3进5去炮，车八平五去马，车1进3兑车，黑稍居下风，但尚属于平稳局势。","text":"3。可以改走炮1进4去卒，红炮五进四去卒，马3进5去炮，车八平五去马，车1进3兑车，黑稍居下风，但尚属于平稳局势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"4。目的牵制黑车，但左翼子力较弱，容易受制。改走车1进3兑车，比较平稳。","text":"4。目的牵制黑车，但左翼子力较弱，容易受制。改走车1进3兑车，比较平稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"5。劣着，白输一子。应该炮7平6，避免失子。又如改走炮1平5，则炮七平二，炮5平7，车三平四，马8进9，兵三进一渡河，红方优势。","text":"5。劣着，白输一子。应该炮7平6，避免失子。又如改走炮1平5，则炮七平二，炮5平7，车三平四，马8进9，兵三进一渡河，红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"6。准备用马兑双相，并取得攻势，佳着。由此红方奠定了胜局。","text":"6。准备用马兑双相，并取得攻势，佳着。由此红方奠定了胜局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"红胜。(图二三二)||||末后如图形势，如黑方士6进5，则车四平九，包4进6去炮，车九进二，帅4进1，后马进八，帅4进1，马七退八，红胜。","text":"红胜。(图二三二)\n\n末后如图形势，如黑方士6进5，则车四平九，包4进6去炮，车九进二，帅4进1，后马进八，帅4进1，马七退八，红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28","raw_text":"应该炮7平6，避免失子。","text":"应该炮7平6，避免失子。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"1:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33","raw_text":"红方优势。","text":"红方优势。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"2:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_24","raw_text":"黑稍居下风，但尚属于平稳局势。","text":"黑稍居下风，但尚属于平稳局势。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"3:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment4_9","raw_text":"这样，同是过河车，但另有不同变化。","text":"这样，同是过河车，但另有不同变化。","source_line_id":"4","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"4:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_pver":["091016"],"DhtmlXQ_viewurl":["?owner=u&id=69744&f=&isSave="],"DhtmlXQ_adddate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_editdate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["第十四局 五七炮对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_length":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["全局"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":["慢棋"],"DhtmlXQ_open":[""],"DhtmlXQ_class":["象棋谱大全-现代棋书专集"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["弈林新编-杨官璘著"],"DhtmlXQ_group":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":["8.对局评注"],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":["1951年11月20日"],"DhtmlXQ_place":["上海市"],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["杨官璘"],"DhtmlXQ_redeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redtime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["罗天扬"],"DhtmlXQ_blackeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blacktime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_endtype":[""],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["杨官璘"],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_refer":["www.dpxq.com"],"DhtmlXQ_other":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_hits":["589"],"DhtmlXQ_price":["1"],"DhtmlXQ_owner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_oldowner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_hidden":["0"]},"source_tag_count":56,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","s